{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港股造好，恒生指數中午收市報25883點，升184點，升幅0.72%。主板半日成交1360億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n金融及地產股表現較好。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n另外，科技指數升0.5%，報4724點。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李意琴\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T04:20:10.950023+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"}}